    <!--
    Free Jaffa faction-leader names.

    PawnKindDef.nameMaker is resolved through NameTriple.FromString. A single
    token leaves the first and last fields empty, causing every later candidate
    to be considered confusingly similar. Each rule therefore emits a formal
    two-part Jaffa name with the personal name repeated as the explicit
    nickname. The full label is "personal name + clan byname", while the short
    pawn label remains the personal name.
    -->
